    x_petey_description_source: tooltip
    label_source: llm
    x_petey_adjudication:
      verdict: proposed
      proposed: declarant_county_nm
      reason: The caption directly below the box reads '(if applicable)' and it sits
        in the declarant's address block after 'county of', so a filer writes the
        county name for the declarant's location; 'declarant_county_nm' better scopes
        this to the declarant's context than the bare 'county_nm'.
      model: claude-sonnet-4-6
      contested: the page check says the name or type does not fit the box
    x_petey_review:
      model: claude-opus-5
      changed:
      - description
      - -semantic_type
      - name
      reason: Box holds a county name, not a person's name, so person_name is wrong.
        The bare name 'county_nm' also cannot be told apart from the administering
        official's county box (admin_county_nm); the caption here belongs to the declarant's
        block, so qualify it.
      before:
        type: string
        semantic_type: person_name
        description: (if applicable)
      old_name: county_nm
      adjudicated: proposed
      judged: 'kept: 0 -> 0'
